 适用场景\n\n- 金汉隆（KITECH）包装设备：线性称重包装机、自动装盒机、数袋线、螺杆包装机、液体包装机、热收缩包装机等的型号、技术规格、适用袋型/盒型\n- 公司产品资料、售后知识、生产工艺相关问题\n- 用户明确说\"问一下知识库\"、\"查知识库\"、\"问数\"时\n\n## 不适用场景\n\n- 与企业知识库无关的通用编程、写作、闲聊问题（直接回答即可）\n", "id": "5ae3351522cf40f7b8210a0148d3ebe8", "created_at": "2026-09-17T19:59:55.309048", "finished_at": null}], "state": "success", "metadata": {}, "created_at": "2026-09-17T19:59:55.318090", "finished_at": null}, {"type": "thinking", "thinking": "The default KB is 通用产品知识库. But my agent's job says to query 《金汉隆-订单业务》 knowledge base's 《模板规则定义》. I need to find the KB ID for 金汉隆-订单业务. Let me list knowledge bases via the API.\n\nLet me first check the weknora MCP driver config in default workspace, and also try listing KBs.\n", "id": "eafedc0af774489e9fe977713153bb38", "created_at": "2026-09-17T19:59:56.478244", "finished_at": null}, {"type": "tool_call", "id": "call_de051cfcc09649d89cbab6ca", "name": "read_file", "input": "{\"file_path\": \"/root/zhiyun-ai-platform/apps/zhizaoyunAIOS/workspace/hub/runtimes/personal-49e1b686b8034127aaeb292f/working/workspaces/default/drivers/mcp/weknora.yaml\"}", "state": "finished", "suggested_rules": [], "created_at": "2026-09-17T19:59:57.343915", "finished_at": null}, {"type": "tool_call", "id": "call_cdb492c9e7f04022b097ac7c", "name": "execute_shell_command", "input": "{\"command\": \"cd /tmp && python3 - <<'EOF'\\nimport json,urllib.request\\nBASE=\\\"http://127.0.0.1:18000\\\"\\ndef post(url,body,token=None):\\n    h={\\\"Content-Type\\\":\\\"application/json\\\"}\\n    if token: h[\\\"Authorization\\\"]=\\\"Bearer \\\"+token\\n    req=urllib.request.Request(url,data=json.dumps(body,ensure_ascii=False).encode(),headers=h,method=\\\"POST\\\")\\n    return json.loads(urllib.request.urlopen(req,timeout=30).read().decode())\\ndef get(url,token=None):\\n    h={}\\n    if token: h[\\\"Authorization\\\"]=\\\"Bearer \\\"+token\\n    req=urllib.request.Request(url,headers=h)\\n    return json.loads(urllib.request.urlopen(req,timeout=30).read().decode())\